    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Sách, tài liệu theo syllabus.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MCP201 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MCP201 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>A Beginner’s Guide to Designing Embedded System Applications on Arm Cortex-M Microcontrollers</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Ariel Lutenberg, Pablo Gomez, Eric Pernia · ARM Education Media · 2022 · ISBN <code>9781911531418</code></p><p><a href=\"https://www.arm.com/resources/education/books/designing-embedded-systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.arm.com/resources/education/books/designing-embedded-systems</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Getting started with STM32: STM32 step-by-step</strong></p><p>STMicroelectronics · STMicroelectronics · 2026 · ISBN <code>N/A</code></p><p><a href=\"https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/STM32StepByStep:Getting_started_with_STM32_:_STM32_step_by_step\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/STM32StepByStep:Getting_started_with_STM32_:_STM32_step_by_step</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Getting started with STM32 system peripherals</strong></p><p>STMicroelectronics · STMicroelectronics · 2026 · ISBN <code>N/A</code></p><p><a href=\"https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/Getting_started_with_STM32_system_peripherals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wiki.st.com/stm32mcu/wiki/Getting_started_with_STM32_system_peripherals</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>STM32 Programming Tutorials &amp; Projects</strong></p><p>Khaled Magdy · DeepBlueMbedded · N/A · ISBN <code>N/A</code></p><p><a href=\"https://deepbluembedded.com/stm32-arm-programming-tutorials/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://deepbluembedded.com/stm32-arm-programming-tutorials/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>STM32 Tutorials</strong></p><p>Arun Rawat · ControllersTech · N/A · ISBN <code>N/A</code></p><p><a href=\"https://controllerstech.com/category/stm32/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://controllerstech.com/category/stm32/</a></p></div>"
